{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13201150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13201150","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320115001:0":{"text":"差点以为，要做一辈子叶角熊了！","source_cn":"差点以为，要做一辈子叶角熊了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971D81F5BEA79007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1320115001":{"text":"差点以为，要做一辈子叶角熊了！","source_cn":"差点以为，要做一辈子叶角熊了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971D81F5BEA79007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320115002:0":{"text":"嗐！是那位魔法师！","source_cn":"嗐！是那位魔法师！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8C12279817D9BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"嗐！是那位魔法师！","female":"嗐！是那位魔法师！","variant_male_record_index":"145504","variant_female_record_index":"145505","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320115003:0":{"text":"我记得他穿着蓝衣服，带着圆框眼镜，金发，留着锅盖头……","source_cn":"我记得他穿着蓝衣服，带着圆框眼镜，金发，留着锅盖头……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDC3C8BFD4BB029","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我记得他穿着蓝衣服，带着圆框眼镜，金发，留着锅盖头……","female":"我记得他穿着蓝衣服，带着圆框眼镜，金发，留着锅盖头……","variant_male_record_index":"145506","variant_female_record_index":"145507","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320115004:0":{"text":"这、这不就是祭典上的那个——","source_cn":"这、这不就是祭典上的那个——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1AD982D80AFB588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320115005:0":{"text":"那个蹩脚魔法师。","source_cn":"那个蹩脚魔法师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2214FEB6AABE34BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320115006:1":{"text":"魔法是一门严谨的艺术！稍有不慎后果不堪设想！","source_cn":"魔法是一门严谨的艺术！稍有不慎后果不堪设想！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB6D54C4433F91FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320115007:0":{"text":"我想体验一下动物的生活，他说能帮我。","source_cn":"我想体验一下动物的生活，他说能帮我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2889DC9A5CFC8927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320115008:0":{"text":"本来说过几小时就会变回来的，谁知道我一连几天都没复原！","source_cn":"本来说过几小时就会变回来的，谁知道我一连几天都没复原！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F73EE3069F90160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320115009:0":{"text":"人们见到我就害怕，也根本没法交流……","source_cn":"人们见到我就害怕，也根本没法交流……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA931DDFF8E2E3A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320115010:0":{"